{"tail":"May the utterance of our lips be pleasing before Thee, O lofty and exalted God, who understands and listens, pays heed and hearkens to the sound of  "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"prayer-part"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"prayer-part","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:areshet_sefatenu/conclusion"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"start":"t:choice","attrs":{}}
{"start":"j:option","attrs":{"corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:condition:prayer:areshet_sefatenu/conclusion/en/first_printing"}}
{"text":" our Teruah. Mayest Thou accept with compassion and favour the order of our praises of Thy Kingdom."}
{"end":"j:option"}
{"start":"j:option","attrs":{"corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:condition:prayer:areshet_sefatenu/conclusion/en/zikhronot_printing"}}
{"text":" our Tekiah. Mayest Thou accept with compassion and favour the order of our verses of remembrance."}
{"end":"j:option"}
{"start":"j:option","attrs":{"corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:condition:prayer:areshet_sefatenu/conclusion/teqiot_veseder_shofarot"}}
{"text":" our Tekioth. Mayest Thou accept with compassion and favour the order of our Shofaroth."}
{"end":"j:option"}
